'''Move Sam''' is a {{Common}} item.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Move Sam''' can be claimed from [[Sam]] after clicking [[Sam#Purpose|Move Sam]] in their [[Sam#Interface|interface]]. If the player already has a '''Move Sam''' in their inventory, [[Sam]] will not give the player another one. This can be bypassed by storing the '''Move Sam''' in a different inventory and claiming another one.

== Usage ==
A '''Move Sam''' can be used to change [[Sam]]'s location on the player's [[Private Island]]. The new spawn location has to be on top of a solid block, and cannot be placed above the void.

